    {
      "unit_id": "4b1406330f71b3328024788ed70e37d3efbf6d31e2ea5c9b9f6ade54350eda73",
      "unit_type": "prose",
      "text": "AT THE BASE OF THE PLATTER RESTS THE FLAMEKISSED BRIOCHE Golem, ITS DEEP AMBER CRUSTS GLOWING FAINTLY AS THOUGH STILL WARM FROM DRAGONFIRE OVENS. THE BRIOCHE, WITH RICH BUTTERY FOLDS AND A SUBTLE SMOKINESS, SYMBOLIZES THE STRENGTH OF MIRATHORN—STURDY, ENDURING, AND BUILT TO SUPPORT DREAMS. DUSTINGS OF EMBER ASH ADORN ITS EDGES, GIVING IT THE APPEARANCE OF FRESHLY LAID BRICKS KISSED BY FIRELIGHT. THE AROMA OF TOASTED CINNAMON AND MOLTEN SUGAR WAFTS CONSTANTLY FROM THE CREATURE, EVOKING HEARTH AND HOME.",
      "structural_path": [],
