      "text": "Flickering Ember Charm : 'The golem emits a flickering glow from its ember-kissed crusts, attempting to charm one creature within 30 feet that can see the light. The target must succeed on a DC 11 Wisdom saving throw or be charmed by the golem for 1 minute, regarding it with fascination as if captivated by the gentle warmth of a fireplace.'",
